{"code": 200, "data": {"additional_feedback": "", "aiWords": 0, "fakePercentage": 0.0, "feedback": "Your Text is Human Written", "h": [], "hi": [], "id": 59227770, "input_text": "Problem: While editing the "BibTeX source" tab, when the source code text area lost focus the code used currentEntry to persist changes. If the selected entry changed before focus loss, the wrong entry could be modified/cleared (causing entries to disappear).

Fix: Pass the entry that actually lost focus into storeSource and use that entry for all updates and undoable edits. The storeSource signature was changed to accept the out-of-focus BibEntry and all field/type/citekey changes are applied to that entry (and recorded in the undo compound) instead of using currentEntry.

Effect: Ensures source edits are saved to the correct entry when the source editor loses focus, preventing accidental removal of fields from other entries. No change to undo behavior; only SourceTab.java was modified.", "isHuman": 100, "originalParagraph": "2026/8/30/86a3f3a3-92e2-47ff-bff9-13ad7fa348b2", "sentences": [], "specialIndexes": [], "specialSentences": [], "textWords": 122}, "message": "Detection complete", "success": true}

{"code": 200, "data": {"additional_feedback": "", "aiWords": 0, "fakePercentage": 0.0, "feedback": "Your Text is Human Written", "h": [], "hi": [], "id": 59225358, "input_text": "Fix change-type not always applied when biblatex source is shown (#5905)

- Bugfix: Ensure changing an entry's type works reliably when the biblatex source view is open. The problem was caused by the ordering in BibEntry.setType: the internal changed flag needs to be set before the type property's value is updated so listeners see a consistent state. The code now sets changed = true before calling this.type.setValue(...), keeping the FieldChangedEvent posting intact.
- Changelog: added an entry describing the fix (#5905).", "isHuman": 100, "originalParagraph": "2026/8/30/fbfcc12b-e339-4a23-bbfd-5fcca826d5a2", "sentences": [], "specialIndexes": [], "specialSentences": [], "textWords": 79}, "message": "Detection complete", "success": true}

